  "content": "<br>\n<div align=\"center\">\n  \n<img alt=\"Exposure\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/mortuusars/resources/main/media/exposure/main.png\" width=225/>\n\n<br>\n<br>\n\n### 胶片摄影模组\n\n<br>\n<br>\n\n<img alt=\"Camera\" width=\"1000\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/mortuusars/resources/main/media/exposure/page_camera.png\"/>\n<br><br>\n<img alt=\"Film\" width=\"1000\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/mortuusars/resources/main/media/exposure/page_film.png\"/>\n<br><br>\n<img alt=\"Developing\" width=\"1000\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/mortuusars/resources/main/media/exposure/page_developing.png\"/>\n<br><br>\n<img alt=\"Printing\" width=\"1000\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/mortuusars/resources/main/media/exposure/page_printing.png\"/>\n<br><br>\n<img alt=\"Photograph\" width=\"1000\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/mortuusars/resources/main/media/exposure/page_photograph.png\"/>\n<br><br>\n<img alt=\"Additional Features\" width=\"260\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/mortuusars/resources/main/media/exposure/page_additional_features.png\"/>\n<br><br>\n<img alt=\"Chromatic\" width=\"1000\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/mortuusars/resources/main/media/exposure/page_chromatic.png\"/>\n<br><br>\n<img alt=\"Interplanar Projector\" width=\"1000\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/mortuusars/resources/main/media/exposure/page_projector.gif\"/>\n<br><br>\n<a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/exposure-polaroid\"><img alt=\"Polaroid\" width=\"1000\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/mortuusars/resources/main/media/exposure/page_polaroid.png\"/></a>\n<br><br>\n<a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/exposure-catalog\"><img alt=\"Catalog\" width=\"1000\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/mortuusars/resources/main/media/exposure/page_catalog.png\"/></a>\n<br><br>\n<img alt=\"Negatives\" width=\"1000\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/mortuusars/resources/main/media/exposure/page_negatives.png\"/>\n\n</div>\n\n<br>\n\n<details>\n  \n<summary>文字版描述</summary>\n<h3>相机</h3>\n\n- 操作相机非常简单：装入胶卷，打开取景器，\n构图并释放快门。<br>\n- 在通过取景器观察时，按住/长按潜行键可控制相机\n设置：焦距、快门速度、闪光灯模式、构图辅助线。<br>\n- 潜行时使用相机可打开附件窗口，\n在其中你可以：\n    - 装入胶片\n    - 装备闪光灯（红石灯）\n    - 修改镜头（ spyglass / 望远镜）\n    - 在镜头上安装滤镜（玻璃板）\n\n<h3>胶片</h3>\n\n- 要捕捉图像，你需要使用感光胶片进行曝光。\n- 你可以使用简单的黑白胶片，或者更复杂、\n更难制作和冲洗的彩色胶片。\n- 单卷胶片可以容纳 16 帧画面。\n- 需要冲洗才能准备胶片进行打印。\n\n<h3>暗房</h3>\n\n- 照片借助暗房方块进行打印。\n- 打印前可以预览底片，以帮助你选择\n最佳的曝光效果。\n- 黑白打印需要纸张和黑染料。\n彩色打印在此基础上还需要青、品红和黄染料。\n\n<h3>照片</h3>\n\n最后，你拥有了你的照片——一个被定格的时间瞬间！\n现在是时候欣赏成果，把它挂在墙上，与朋友分享，\n或者卖给《国家地理》杂志了。可能性无穷无尽。\n\n</details>\n\n<iframe width=\"1000\" height=\"350\" src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/HI9Bnjc9HYs\" title=\"YouTube This Mod Adds Photography in Minecraft!\" frameborder=\"0\" allow=\"accelerometer; autoplay; clipboard-write; encrypted-media; gyroscope; picture-in-picture; web-share\" allowfullscreen></iframe>\n<br><br>\n\n<div align=\"center\">\n\n<h1><a href=\"https://moddedmc.wiki/en/project/exposure/latest/docs\">Wiki</a></h1>\n\n__已知不兼容项:__\n\n</div>\n\n- Optifine - 已知会导致与其他模组产生冲突。建议使用 Sodium/Embeddium 替代。\n- Visual Overhaul - 打开相机控制界面时会崩溃 - [GitHub Issue](https://github.com/mortuusars/Exposure/issues/19)\n- Exordium - 通过取景器观察时会出现问题和闪烁。\n- FastAnim (Fabric) - 会导致相机视角下玩家模型动画损坏。[Github Issue](https://github.com/mortuusars/Exposure/issues/71)\n\n<h1> </h1>\n\n<div align=\"center\">\n\n#### 喜欢这个模组吗？你的支持将使我能够继续开发此模组及其他模组！\n[<img alt=\"Patreon\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/mortuusars/resources/main/media/banners/patreon_seamless.png\" width=558.73/>](https://www.patreon.com/mortuusars/membership)[<img alt=\"PayPal\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/mortuusars/resources/main/media/banners/paypal_seamless.png\" width=191.75/>](https://www.paypal.com/donate/?hosted_button_id=4VPMCBCLZVUEA)\n[<img alt=\"Golden Camera\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/mortuusars/resources/main/media/exposure/page_golden_camera.png\" width=1000/>](https://www.patreon.com/mortuusars/posts/rewards-129739244)\n\n<h1> </h1>\n\n[<img alt=\"Discord Server\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/mortuusars/resources/main/media/banners/discord.png\" width=500/>](https://discord.gg/FzHKGDW2et)\n\n</div>",
